    {
      "name": "About",
      "type": "comment",
      "parameters": {},
      "node_position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -420
      },
      "size": {
        "x": 900,
        "y": 214
      },
      "title": "About this material",
      "text": "Sculpted terrain material, built from sources/species.png. Scale and relief: Repeat must equal its metres in materials.json (24 m); Relief is its height range in metres. After changing Relief, set the Material node's Depth scale to 4 x relief / repeat. Pigment changes the colour; SurfaceResponse the normal strength, cavity and roughness. The ...PNG8 groups and the nodes after them only store exact file values; leave them. Export: File > Export material > Godot > Godot 4 Standard into data/models/board/textures/terrain/surfaces, then Reload assets in the game's Tuning panel.",
      "color": {
        "type": "Color",
        "r": 0.18,
        "g": 0.23,
        "b": 0.28,
        "a": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "PigmentSource",
